================================================================================
Vendored content (Kotlin grammar)
================================================================================

The Kotlin tree-sitter grammar is vendored in-tree as build input for cairn's
own compiled extension. Only the upstream generated parser output and LICENSE
are carried in-tree; the upstream packaging (setup.py, pyproject.toml,
bindings/, Cargo.toml, package.json) is not vendored.

fwcd/tree-sitter-kotlin (https://github.com/fwcd/tree-sitter-kotlin),
Copyright (c) 2019 fwcd. The generated sources are vendored at pinned commit
1852ea17b7f60fb3f9d84e0b1555d56b46b39fb1 (upstream main HEAD, committed
2026-08-02, vendored 2026-08-25) under vendor/tree-sitter-kotlin/
(src/parser.c, src/scanner.c, src/grammar.json, src/node-types.json, and the
src/tree_sitter/ headers), and are licensed under the MIT License. The full
license text is retained in-tree, unmodified, at
vendor/tree-sitter-kotlin/LICENSE.
